# Each mutation plants a bug someone could ship in a copy of Scraper.tla; its property must then fail.

mutation lost wakeup: after deferring, the agent job never checks whether the source was let go meanwhile
detects DeferredRuns
cfg Live-PromptWake
-     /\ IF Free THEN Wake(A, "wakeBusy") ELSE NoWake(A, "wakeBusy")
+     /\ NoWake(A, "wakeBusy")

mutation review_pending no longer wakes jobs stranded on a source nothing holds
detects DeferredRuns
cfg Live-Deferred
- Stranded == ScheduleWakes /\ WokeA /\ Free
+ Stranded == FALSE

mutation an agent run that failed with unread messages is reopened too
detects ReopensBounded
cfg Verified
-     /\ IF status[A] = "succeeded" /\ unread
+     /\ IF status[A] \in {"succeeded", "failed"} /\ unread

mutation Standing.working returns ONBOARDING for a live source
detects LiveStatus
- Working(k) == IF k = "heal" THEN "healing" ELSE IF Live THEN st ELSE "onboarding"
+ Working(k) == IF k = "heal" THEN "healing" ELSE "onboarding"

mutation the reaper fails deferred runs too
detects DeferredRuns
cfg Live-Deferred
-     /\ status[r] \in {"queued", "running"} /\ pc[r] \in Gone
+     /\ status[r] \in {"queued", "running", "deferred"} /\ pc[r] \in Gone

mutation an agent job that finds the source held is skipped instead of deferred
detects AgentRuns
cfg Live-Deferred
-     /\ CASE r = A -> /\ status' = [status EXCEPT ![A] = "deferred"]
+     /\ CASE r = A -> /\ status' = [status EXCEPT ![A] = "skipped"]

mutation a claim ignores a live lease
detects OneLeased
cfg Verified
-     /\ pc[r] = "claim" /\ Free
+     /\ pc[r] = "claim"

mutation an agent run that ended well with unread messages is not reopened
detects MessagesRead
cfg Live-Messages
-     /\ IF status[A] = "succeeded" /\ unread
+     /\ IF FALSE

mutation a merged pull request is closed, not registered
detects MergedRegistered
cfg Live-Merged
-           THEN /\ vstate' = [vstate EXCEPT ![i] = "merged"] /\ current' = i
+           THEN /\ vstate' = [vstate EXCEPT ![i] = "closed"] /\ UNCHANGED current

mutation a repair that proposed a version leaves a live source HEALING
detects KeepsCrawling
cfg Live-Crawled
-     /\ st' = IF Live THEN "ready" ELSE "in_review"
+     /\ st' = IF Live THEN st ELSE "in_review"

mutation approve checks that the source is free but never takes the lease
detects NoMergeWhileAgent
cfg Verified-Approve
-     /\ IF ApproveLeased THEN Free /\ holder' = P /\ lapsed' = FALSE ELSE UNCHANGED lease
+     /\ IF ApproveLeased THEN Free /\ UNCHANGED lease ELSE UNCHANGED lease

mutation the lease query counts a lease held by approve as free
detects NoMergeWhileAgent
cfg Verified-Approve
- Free == holder = None \/ lapsed
+ Free == holder \in {None, P} \/ lapsed
